  <CENTER><H1>Patch Message</H1></CENTER>
<H2>March 21st, 3:00 am</H2>
<BR>
<BR>
- Contact buffs have once again been disabled for bards to prevent songs from locking up<BR>
<BR>
- Fixed a bug that was causing the &quot;Soandso begins to cast a spell&quot; message to not display<BR>
<BR>
- Fixed the bug that was causing the last hit message for another player to be displayed even if you had other's hits off<BR>
<BR>
- Added more info to the /hitsmode help<BR>
<BR>
- Added another option to the /hitsmode command to allow users to force the windows to be displayed even if empty<BR>
<BR>
New Hitsmode Usage: /hitsmode <my|me|other> <on|off|m2|m3|m4|m5> <X> <Y> <COUNT> <FONTSIZE> <HEADER> <BG> <WIDTH> <FORCEDRAW><BR>
<BR>
Where:  <FORCEDRAW> is 1 to force the window to draw even if empty.<BR>
<BR>
- Changed it so hitsmode windows do NOT draw when in &quot;normal&quot; old UI mode (e.g. spellbook)<BR>
<BR>
- Fixed a bug that was giving bards an error message related to /targetgroupbuff every time they zone. (&quot;This ability does not work with bard songs.&quot;)<BR>
<BR>
<BR>
- The EverQuest Team<BR>
